{
  "name": "Ghost Fox",
  "type": "character",
  "img": "systems/heroic5e/assets/characters/ghost-fox/Portrait-Ghost-Fox.png",
  "system": {
    "biography": "Linh “Lynn” Duvall — Ghost Fox\n\n“The City’s Silent Hunter”\n\nClass: Striker\nOrigin: Trained\nCalling: Avenger\nSide: Heroic\n\nDescription Ghost Fox is an urban vigilante who wages a one-woman war against the Syndicate, the sprawling criminal organization responsible for her father’s murder. The daughter of a Vietnamese mother and a former Marine turned anti-drug task force operative, Lynn grew up between two worlds: disciplined military structure and quiet cultural tradition. After her father was killed for getting too close to the Syndicate’s operations, she vanished from public life for several years before reappearing as Ghost Fox, a rooftop predator feared throughout the city’s criminal underworld. Ghost Fox specializes in stealth, infiltration, surveillance, and precision strikes. She is not a flashy superhero. She is the figure criminals glimpse watching from a rooftop before the lights go out. Despite her cold reputation, ordinary people in the neighborhoods she protects often see her as a guardian spirit watching over the streets at night. Personality Quiet, observant, disciplined, and emotionally guarded. Lynn rarely opens up to others and struggles deeply with trust, grief, and anger. She tends to keep teammates at arm’s length, preferring to work alone whenever possible. Beneath the hardened exterior, however, she possesses a fierce protective instinct, especially toward civilians, children, and vulnerable people caught in the crossfire of crime and corruption. Powers Ghost Fox possesses no true superpowers, but operates at the absolute peak of human capability. She combines elite martial arts training, extreme agility, stealth tactics, parkour movement, wall-crawling gear, retractable claw weapons, smoke devices, grappling systems, and advanced infiltration skills into a terrifying urban combat style built around speed, surprise, and precision.",
    "notes": "Combat Reference\nPower Die: d8\nProwess: +2\nTrained Saves: DEX, FIG.\nTrained Skills: Acrobatics, Athletics, Finesse, Insight, Investigation, Stealth, Streetwise.\nClass EV (FIG): 16\nGadgetry EV (INT): 13",
